1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,790
Are you here to size me up?

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,260
Even if you were the devil,

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,880
your beauty would still be matchless.

4
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,640
No...

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:11,890
That's not it.

6
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:12,890
Minato.

7
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:13,640
Yes?

8
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,770
Because Viola deeply loves the Duke,

9
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:19,350
she genuinely wants to move Olivia.

10
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:22,190
Because she loves him so much,

11
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:25,110
even if it breaks her heart,

12
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,690
she'll do absolutely anything
for his sake.

13
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,990
Do you understand?

14
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,870
I do...

15
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,080
Why don't we call it a day?

16
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,790
Everyone is exhausted.

17
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,000
I'm sorry...

18
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:45,960
Minato.

19
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:46,960
Yes?

20
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:49,630
Try to picture

21
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:51,130
the person you love in your mind.

22
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,640
Huh...?

23
00:01:01,190 --> 00:01:03,810
Try to picture

24
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:05,070
the person you love.

25
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:09,820
The person I love...

26
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:13,310
Someone who is important to me...

27
00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:17,700
Mmm, this is delicious!

28
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:22,040
I want you to shine that light
and brighten everyone's world.

29
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,500
Take a deep breath.

30
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:27,630
It's going to be okay.

31
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,260
You don't have to hold back in front of me.

32
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:36,330
(The person I love...)
